      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The heroes reel in the wake of last issue’s shocking finale. Thor finds himself unwelcome in two homes. Steve Rogers makes the decision of a lifetime. And Iron Man prepares to make the ultimate sacrifice. Every move the heroes make just serves to make The Serpent stronger—and the feat he accomplishes in this issue will rock the Avengers."
